 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "PinManager() starts empty. addPin(pinId, score, pinType) stores a new pin (ids are distinct across all calls). getTopK(pinType, k) returns the ids of the min(k, count) highest-scoring pins of that type, highest score first, ties by smaller id; an unknown type gives []. Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing.",
